OL,3,GNEWSANI secretary to ban the Drumcree
OL,4,Aparade
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthern Ireland Secretary Sir Chris
OL,7,FBryant is to ban the Drumcree parade.
OL,9,FThe dispute has has led to a stand-off
OL,10,Fbetween Orangemen and nationalist
OL,11,Fresidents of the Garvaghy Road in
OL,12,FPortadown lasting almost two weeks.
OL,14,FThis breaking news story is being
OL,15,Fupdated and more details will be
OL,16,Fpublished shortly. Please refresh the
OL,17,Fpage for the fullest version.
OL,19,FYou can receive Breaking News on a
OL,20,Fsmartphone or tablet via the BBC News
OL,21,FApp. You can also follow @BBCBreaking
OL,22,Fon X to get the latest alerts.
